menu "MPU6050 calibration"

    config MPU6050_RECOVER_LAST_LOG
        bool "Recover this board's six measurements from the October 8 log"
        default n
        help
            One-board repair option. Imports the six real training means only
            when no pending or completed calibration exists. Three new tilted
            validations are still mandatory. Disable when using another module.

    config MPU6050_FORCE_ACCEL_CALIBRATION
        bool "Run six-face accelerometer calibration even when a saved record exists"
        default n
        help
            Enable to recalibrate this sensor. Disable after successful calibration;
            otherwise the six-face procedure runs on every reboot.

    config MPU6050_CALIBRATION_WARMUP_MS
        int "Minimum sensor warm-up time before calibration (milliseconds)"
        range 0 300000
        default 20000
        help
            This is only a minimum warm-up delay. Temperature stability and motion
            are checked separately; no temperature compensation model is assumed.

endmenu
